        "parameters": {
          "color": 7,
          "width": 760,
          "height": 484,
          "content": "### 3. Send once a human approves\n\nFires the moment someone approves in Tracira, whether they approved the AI's reply or rewrote it first.\nThe text and its recipient come straight from Tracira, so this branch just sends it. Reject it and nothing goes out."
